<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main id="mainContent" class="pageMain pageWidth">
    <section class="homeIntro">
      <h1>Honolulu Police Department arrest statistics</h1>
      <p class="homeLead">Check Da Kine turns the Honolulu Police Department's published arrest logs into statistics anyone can explore.</p>
      <p>HPD publishes a new arrest log as a PDF about every six hours. We read each one, pull out every arrest, and keep a single de-duplicated record of each, so the numbers can be checked against the Attorney General's <a href="https://ag.hawaii.gov/cpja/rs/cih/">annual crime reports</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Coming soon</h2>
      <ul class="homeComingList">
        <li>A dashboard of arrests by age, sex, and ethnicity</li>
        <li>A searchable table of arrests</li>
        <li>An archive of every arrest log</li>
        <li>Active police dispatch calls</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
